WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.253
This guide uses the running app with fictional training records.

5
00:00:04.253 --> 00:00:07.404
Camera, location and cloud responses are simulated.

9
00:00:07.404 --> 00:00:10.369
Sign in with your company username and password.

13
00:00:10.369 --> 00:00:13.643
The written guide includes every task and setup step.

17
00:00:14.443 --> 00:00:18.302
First use the invitation from your subcontractor administrator.

21
00:00:18.302 --> 00:00:20.936
Enter your own name, username and password.

25
00:00:20.936 --> 00:00:23.815
Your company and role come from the invitation.

29
00:00:23.815 --> 00:00:27.797
Your administrator must approve your account before you can work.

33
00:00:28.597 --> 00:00:30.626
My work shows your assignments.

37
00:00:30.626 --> 00:00:33.769
Check the building photo, date and instructions.

41
00:00:33.769 --> 00:00:37.762
Open the assignment and read the exact work area and hazards.

45
00:00:37.762 --> 00:00:40.577
Your assigned team is listed in the record.

49
00:00:40.577 --> 00:00:42.933
Use search filters only when needed.

53
00:00:43.733 --> 00:00:45.478
At the site, choose Check in.

57
00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:47.944
Select the correct assigned crew members.

61
00:00:47.944 --> 00:00:52.034
Capture your current location and allow precise location permission.

65
00:00:52.034 --> 00:00:55.643
Check the position and accuracy before recording attendance.

69
00:00:55.643 --> 00:00:58.230
Every checkout needs another fresh capture.

73
00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:02.127
Choose Upload evidence and select Before work.

77
00:01:02.127 --> 00:01:04.483
Tap Take photo, then Capture photo.

81
00:01:04.483 --> 00:01:05.829
Inspect the preview.

85
00:01:05.829 --> 00:01:09.262
Keep the picture if it is useful, or choose Retake.

89
00:01:09.262 --> 00:01:12.493
This demonstration uses a synthetic camera feed.

93
00:01:13.293 --> 00:01:14.246
Tap Keep photo.

97
00:01:14.246 --> 00:01:17.805
The camera opens again so you can take the next picture.

101
00:01:17.805 --> 00:01:19.140
Repeat one at a time.

105
00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:23.524
Review your thumbnails and remove unwanted pictures before uploading.

109
00:01:23.524 --> 00:01:26.321
Each picture retains its own capture record.

113
00:01:27.121 --> 00:01:28.312
Tap Upload photos.

117
00:01:28.312 --> 00:01:30.696
Wait until every picture says Saved.

121
00:01:30.696 --> 00:01:36.124
Failed items remain available for retry, while saved items are not uploaded again.

125
00:01:36.124 --> 00:01:42.348
Originals remain unchanged; management sees a stamped viewing copy and the server upload time.

129
00:01:43.148 --> 00:01:46.103
Update the checklist as the work is completed.

133
00:01:46.103 --> 00:01:49.573
Hauling jobs also need whole loads and their timecard.

137
00:01:49.573 --> 00:01:56.640
If work is only partial, impossible, or required evidence is missing, use Work outcome and explain the reason.

141
00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:59.146
Never invent a completed task or photo.

145
00:01:59.946 --> 00:02:04.820
Use Report a problem for blocked access, equipment, weather or safety issues.

149
00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:07.605
Describe the problem and choose its urgency.

153
00:02:07.605 --> 00:02:10.706
Saving creates an issue and in-app notifications.

157
00:02:10.706 --> 00:02:14.567
Email delivery uses the configured recipients and dispatcher.

161
00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:16.909
Immediate danger needs a direct call.

165
00:02:17.709 --> 00:02:22.465
Open the evidence uploader, choose Issue evidence and select the related issue.

169
00:02:22.465 --> 00:02:24.692
Take a clear picture or choose files.

173
00:02:24.692 --> 00:02:26.438
You can add several pictures.

177
00:02:26.438 --> 00:02:30.171
Management can open the issue and its evidence inside the app.

181
00:02:30.971 --> 00:02:35.040
When work is finished, choose After work and take the final pictures.

185
00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:39.640
Show the same areas clearly enough for management to compare before and after.

189
00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:44.240
Upload and wait for the saved confirmation before leaving the evidence screen.

193
00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:50.009
Choose Check out, capture a new current location and enter unpaid break minutes.

197
00:02:50.009 --> 00:02:51.624
Save the attendance event.

201
00:02:51.624 --> 00:02:59.078
If checkout was missed, record the real current event and explain a corrected claim; never backdate original attendance.

205
00:02:59.878 --> 00:03:01.398
Choose Submit my hours.

209
00:03:01.398 --> 00:03:04.174
Normally keep Use the exact recorded time.

213
00:03:04.174 --> 00:03:06.950
A different claim requires a clear reason.

217
00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:09.461
All crew members must check out first.

221
00:03:09.461 --> 00:03:14.286
Submit, then read the confirmation so you know who reviews the work next.

225
00:03:15.086 --> 00:03:18.780
My hours separates recorded, claimed and accepted time.

229
00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:21.400
Your company reviews first, then N P I.

233
00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:24.490
Issues shows acknowledgements and resolutions.

237
00:03:24.490 --> 00:03:25.901
Alerts shows updates.

241
00:03:25.901 --> 00:03:32.552
If a correction is requested, follow the reason, update the permitted information and submit again.
